SUMMARY:Holiday Best Kept Secrets Tour
DESCRIPTION:The Bird-in-Hand Artisan Village will be among the stops on the Lancaster County Best Kept Secrets Holiday tour\, December 3-12.  The Best Kept Secrets Tour is a self-guided tour where you’ll travel place to place\, in your own vehicle—going where you want\, when you want.  Your ticket is valid the entire time—do what you can in a day or take several days—it’s up to you. The tour features amazing stops including a variety of home décor & furnishings stores\, craft shops and artisan wares\, gift shops\, greenhouses filled with holiday greens\, a few specialty shops and more!   There is something for everyone! \nTickets ($12) are available at Artisan Village or online beginning October 25.
URL:https://bird-in-hand.com/event/holiday-best-kept-secrets-tour/
LOCATION:Bird-in-Hand Artisan Village\, 2705 Old Philadelphia Pike\, Bird-in-Hand\, PA\, 17505\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://bird-in-hand.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/BKST.jpg
END:VEVENT
